{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12107010","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:5:1210701001:0":{"text":"太好了！终于平安到瞭望角了！一路上也没遇到海怪！","source_cn":"太好了！终于平安到瞭望角了！一路上也没遇到海怪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85D84B2A3BF0DDE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210701002:1":{"text":"但这里的守卫很多……我们要怎么进去？","source_cn":"但这里的守卫很多……我们要怎么进去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65B2B88F299700CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210701003:1":{"text":"只是喽啰，不是我们的对手。","source_cn":"只是喽啰，不是我们的对手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4425F715D2372159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210701004:0":{"text":"没必要硬闯。","source_cn":"没必要硬闯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A34D68451DC13F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210701005:1":{"text":"随手打晕几个水鬼，换上他们的衣服，不就能光明正大地进去了？","source_cn":"随手打晕几个水鬼，换上他们的衣服，不就能光明正大地进去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD958CD6BB7688EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210701006:1